# Behind-the-Ear Anti-Sleep Driver Sensor 🚗💤🎧

A lightweight, wearable safety prototype modeled after a behind-the-ear hearing aid. Designed to detect driver drowsiness in real time using simple gravity mechanics and a closed analog circuit.

