## 📌 Project Overview

Drowsy driving is a leading cause of highway accidents worldwide. This project presents a low-cost, non-invasive wearable alert system. Mounted comfortably over the user's outer ear, the device uses a tilt switch placed at the top joint to trigger an immediate alarm whenever the driver's head nods forward due to exhaustion.

